# Drop your Blender-exported .glb files here.
# Expected filenames (matching COLLECTION in garage.html):
#
#   phantom-001.glb
#   specter-042.glb
#   ghost-108.glb
#   wraith-217.glb
#   banshee-333.glb
#   revenant-512.glb
#   poltergeist-777.glb
#   specter-999.glb
#
# When a .glb is present the viewer loads it automatically.
# When it is missing the viewer falls back to the procedural
# stand-in car coloured with that NFT's color/accent values.
